{
  "public_post": "Update: All contaminated loaves have been discarded and refunds are being processed for anyone who bought this week. Please continue to avoid co‑op bread until we announce it is safe again. Use the farm stand for now.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Confirm all loaves discarded, issue refunds today, contact the clinic and health authority for incident report, source a safe flour batch, and prepare a timeline for safe resumption. No baking until clearance.",
